{"etape": 16, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-13T17:13:00.608033Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "\n\nI've checked the status of all flights in your upcoming reservations. None of them were cancelled by the airline. Here's the summary:\n\n**✅ Eligible for cancellation (Business class):**\n1. **8C8K4E** — BOS → MIA → DEN, May 24, Business, 2 passengers\n2. **LU15PA** — SFO → PHX → SFO, May 23, Business, 2 passengers\n\n**❌ Not eligible for cancellation:**\n3. **MSJ4OA** — DFW → SEA → SFO, May 22, Economy (booked May 5, no airline cancellation; \"other reasons\" is not covered by your travel insurance, which only covers health or weather reasons)\n4. **XAZ3C0** — ATL → LGA → CLT, May 27, Basic Economy (booked May 6, no insurance)\n5. **UDMOP1** — SFO → PHX/PHL → SFO, May 28–29, Basic Economy (booked May 9, no insurance)\n\nUnfortunately, I can only cancel the two Business class reservations (8C8K4E and LU15PA). The other three do not meet our cancellation policy requirements.\n\n**Would you like me to proceed with cancelling 8C8K4E and LU15PA?** Refunds will go to your original payment methods (gift cards) within 5 to 7 business days."}, "resultat": "Oui, s'il vous plaît. Please cancel 8C8K4E and LU15PA.\n\nAnd for the others, the ones not eligible for cancellation, I still want to cancel them. I understand there will be no refund, but I want to give up my seat for someone else who needs it. Can you do that for me?", "erreur": null}
