{"etape": 19, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-13T17:14:24.719537Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "\n\nBoth cancellations are complete:\n\n✅ **8C8K4E** (BOS → MIA → DEN, May 24, Business) — cancelled. Refund of **$5,680** to your original gift card (gift_card_1647044).\n✅ **LU15PA** (SFO → PHX → SFO, May 23, Business) — cancelled. Refund of **$2,366** to your original gift card (gift_card_7397998).\n\nBoth refunds will be processed to the original payment methods within **5 to 7 business days**.\n\nRegarding the other three reservations (MSJ4OA, XAZ3C0, UDMOP1): I'm sorry, but I'm unable to cancel them. Our cancellation policy only permits cancellation when one of the following applies: the booking was made within the last 24 hours, the flight was cancelled by the airline, it's a Business class reservation, or you have travel insurance and the reason is covered (health or weather). None of these conditions are met for those three reservations, and unfortunately, the willingness to forfeit the refund does not change the eligibility rules. I also don't have a way to transfer a reservation to another person.\n\nOne option that may align with your goal: the policy does allow you to **modify the passenger names** on a reservation (as long as the number of passengers stays the same). If there's a specific person you'd like to give your seat to, I can help update the passenger details on any of those reservations. Would you like to do that?"}, "resultat": "Ah, je vois. So I cannot cancel them even if I don't want a refund? That is a bit frustrating, but I understand the policy.\n\nNo, I don't have specific people in mind to transfer the tickets to. I just wanted to make the seats available.\n\nSo, to be clear, there is absolutely no way to cancel MSJ4OA, XAZ3C0, and UDMOP1, even without a refund? C'est dommage.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 20, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-13T17:14:52.522237Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "\n\nI understand your frustration, and I'm sorry. To be completely transparent: based on our cancellation policy, **no, I cannot cancel MSJ4OA, XAZ3C0, or UDMOP1**, even without a refund. The policy only allows cancellation under the specific conditions I mentioned (booked within 24 hours, airline cancellation, Business class, or covered insurance reason), and none of those apply to these three reservations. There is no provision for a voluntary \"no-refund\" cancellation.\n\nIf you'd like, I can transfer you to a human agent to see if there are any additional options or exceptions I'm not aware of. Would you like me to do that?"}, "resultat": "Oui, s'il vous plaît. If there is any possibility, I would like to speak to a human agent. Merci.###TRANSFER###", "erreur": null}
